      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且听快递员同伴说，\n要让墓地动起来是需要条件的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E14542C5FEB90125458540C4F348BF4FF0C000A89818BA95893573052A88D776765662F9700898167614EF67684300200100002011401A70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一、必须是晚上。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0030015FC5987B662F665A4E0A300200100002011401A70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "二、同行宝可梦只有1只。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8C3001540C884C5B9D53EF68A653EA6709003153EA300200100002011401A70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "三、要从北侧入口进去。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E09300189814ECE53174FA7516553E38FDB53BB300200100002011401A70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "四、要在心中默念这段话：<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n孤身一人来墓地，墓头墓脑惊魂记。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56DB3001898157285FC34E2D9ED85FF58FD96BB58BDDFF1A00100001BE01000A5B648EAB4E004EBA676558935730FF0C589359345893811160CA9B428BB0300200100002011401A70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不敢去一探究竟。\n希望你能帮我确认下传闻是不是真的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
